{"seq":1,"slug":"what-are-pgms","title":"什么是概率图模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/probabilistic-graphical-models/foundations/what-are-pgms","wordCount":1687,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"什么是概率图模型\">什么是概率图模型</h1><p>设想你要给一家医院建一个辅助诊断系统，涉及 30 个二值变量：症状、化验结果、疾病、用药。这 30 个变量的联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>30</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(X_1, \\dots, X_{30})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在最朴素的表示下需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>30</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{30} - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个数字——超过十亿个参数。没有任何数据集能估出这么多参数，也没有任何机器能存下这张表。概率图模型的全部出发点，就是观察到：现实中的变量并不是「人人直接影响人人」，绝大多数依赖是局部的、稀疏的。把这种稀疏结构用一张图显式画出来，那张十亿条目的表就能塌缩成几十个小表的乘积。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>概率图模型由两部分严丝合缝地咬合而成：一个图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 和一族概率因子。图的节点是随机变量，图的边（有向或无向）编码「直接依赖」。图不携带数值，它只规定了联合分布必须服从的一种因子分解形式；具体数值由附着在图上的局部因子提供。这种「结构与数值分离」的设计，让我们能分别推理图的拓扑（带来哪些条件独立）和参数的取值（具体多大概率）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[联合分布 P 巨大且不可存] --&gt; B{现实依赖是否稀疏}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[用图编码直接依赖]&#10;  C --&gt; D[图诱导因子分解]&#10;  D --&gt; E[联合分布 = 局部因子乘积]&#10;  E --&gt; F[紧凑表示&lt;br/&gt;高效推断&lt;br/&gt;可学习参数]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| G[退化为完整联合表&lt;br/&gt;PGM 无收益]\">graph TD\n  A[联合分布 P 巨大且不可存] --&gt; B{现实依赖是否稀疏}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[用图编码直接依赖]\n  C --&gt; D[图诱导因子分解]\n  D --&gt; E[联合分布 = 局部因子乘积]\n  E --&gt; F[紧凑表示&lt;br/&gt;高效推断&lt;br/&gt;可学习参数]\n  B --&gt;|否| G[退化为完整联合表&lt;br/&gt;PGM 无收益]</pre><p>把三种「视角」放在一起对照，能看清 PGM 究竟省了什么：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>视角</th>\n<th>朴素联合表</th>\n<th>概率图模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参数量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(2^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个二值变量）</td>\n<td>与最大局部因子规模成正比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>来源</td>\n<td>全连接、无独立假设</td>\n<td>图编码的条件独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推断查询</td>\n<td>对整张表求和，指数代价</td>\n<td>利用因子结构，常可多项式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性</td>\n<td>无结构、黑箱</td>\n<td>边即依赖，结构可读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习难度</td>\n<td>数据需求指数增长</td>\n<td>数据需求随因子规模增长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"图如何换来紧凑性\">图如何换来紧凑性</h2><p>紧凑性的来源是一个朴素却深刻的事实：如果变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 在给定它的「直接相关者」后，与其余所有变量条件独立，那么联合分布里关于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的那一项就只依赖少数几个变量，而不是全部。把每个变量的这种局部依赖收集起来相乘，就得到整个联合分布。</p>\n<p>举一个三变量例子。设「下雨」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 影响「路面湿」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，「洒水车」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 也影响「路面湿」，而下雨与洒水车互不影响。朴素表示需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^3-1=7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 个数。但若我们承认 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 独立、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 只在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R, S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 后才确定，联合分布就分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>R</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(R)P(S)P(W \\mid R, S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——只需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 + 1 + 4 = 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 个数。三个变量省得不多，但这个比例随变量数指数级放大：当链条变长，朴素表示翻倍增长，而因子表示只线性增长。这种「把指数压成线性」的杠杆，正是因子分解的威力，详见 <a href=\"independence-factorization\">独立性与因子分解</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个统一框架-两种主要方言\">一个统一框架，两种主要方言</h2><p>PGM 不是单一模型，而是一个框架。同一个建模问题，常常既能用有向图也能用无向图表达，二者是同一思想的两种方言。有向图（贝叶斯网络）用带箭头的边表示「因到果」式的非对称依赖，每个节点配一张条件概率表，且全图无环；无向图（马尔可夫随机场）用无向边表示对称的相互影响，靠团上的势函数和一个全局归一化常数定义分布。</p>\n<p>选择哪种方言，取决于问题的依赖结构是否有自然方向。基因到性状有方向，适合有向图；图像里相邻像素相互制约没有方向，适合无向图。还有第三种「因子图」把二者的因子结构统一表达，常用作推断算法的底层数据结构。三类表示的取舍与适用场景，在 <a href=\"representation-types\">表示类型</a> 里系统展开。这里只需记住：图的形状不同，但「用图换紧凑、用因子定数值」的内核完全一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么这个框架值得学\">为什么这个框架值得学</h2><p>PGM 的价值不只在于省存储。第一，它把不确定性当一等公民：输出不是一个点估计，而是一个概率分布，天然能表达「我有多确定」。第二，它能处理缺失数据和隐变量——只要在图里把缺失的节点当作待推断的变量即可，这套机制在 <a href=\"../learning-practice/parameter-learning\">参数学习</a> 里被反复使用。第三，它支持回答多种查询：边缘概率、最可能配置、以及（在因果版本里）干预后的分布。第四，它的结构是可解释的，边代表的依赖关系本身就是领域知识的载体。</p>\n<p>正因如此，PGM 既是经典机器学习的支柱，也在现代以新形态延续——从隐马尔可夫模型、条件随机场，到概率编程语言，再到与神经网络融合的深度生成模型，背后都是同一套图与因子的语言。这些现代落地形态在 <a href=\"../learning-practice/applications-tools\">应用与工具</a> 中详述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么时候-pgm-不划算\">什么时候 PGM 不划算</h2><p>PGM 的收益全部来自「依赖确实稀疏」这一前提。如果变量之间几乎两两相关，图会退化成近似全连接，因子分解省不下任何参数，反而多出一层图的构建与维护成本。判断一个问题是否适合 PGM，可以先看三个信号。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>依赖是否局部：领域知识或相关性分析能否指出每个变量只直接受少数几个变量影响。</li>\n<li>不确定性是否重要：若只需一个点预测、不在意置信度，判别式模型往往更直接省事。</li>\n<li>结构本身是否有意义：若图结构无人关心，纯预测任务用端到端模型通常更强。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>用代码把参数规模的差距算清楚，就能直观判断值不值得上 PGM：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"n, k = 30, 2                  # 30 个二值变量&#10;naive = k ** n - 1            # 朴素联合表：10 亿量级，无法估计&#10;per_node = (k - 1) * k ** 2   # 每个节点的条件概率表最多 4 个数&#10;pgm = n * per_node            # PGM：约 120 个数，可估计、可存储\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n, k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  # 30 个二值变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">naive </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 朴素联合表：10 亿量级，无法估计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">per_node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 每个节点的条件概率表最多 4 个数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pgm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> per_node            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># PGM：约 120 个数，可估计、可存储</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>概率图模型用一张图编码变量间的直接依赖，把指数级的联合分布塌缩成局部因子的乘积。</li>\n<li>框架的内核是「结构与数值分离」：图规定因子分解形式，局部因子提供具体数值。</li>\n<li>紧凑性的根源是条件独立——给定直接相关者后与其余变量独立，详见 <a href=\"independence-factorization\">独立性与因子分解</a>。</li>\n<li>同一问题常有有向、无向两种方言，取决于依赖是否有自然方向，比较见 <a href=\"representation-types\">表示类型</a>。</li>\n<li>PGM 的优势是把不确定性、缺失数据、可解释性统一在一个框架里，是经典与现代机器学习的共同底座。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"什么是概率图模型","id":"什么是概率图模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"图如何换来紧凑性","id":"图如何换来紧凑性"},{"level":2,"text":"一个统一框架，两种主要方言","id":"一个统一框架-两种主要方言"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么这个框架值得学","id":"为什么这个框架值得学"},{"level":2,"text":"什么时候 PGM 不划算","id":"什么时候-pgm-不划算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"独立性与因子分解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/probabilistic-graphical-models/foundations/independence-factorization"}}